# Port patch, a new cheat (wish of the project owner, 16.11.2026; the app menu's CHEATS page, PLAYER, "Steady aim",
# off by default): "Ist dieser Button aktiviert, soll bei allen Waffen, egal ob Zielfernrohr oder Laserpointer das
# zielen starr sein und sich nicht durch die Atembewegung auf und ab bewegen." While runtime/cheats.cpp
# re4_steady_aim says so (bit 31 of the app's cheat switches), the aim moves only when the player moves it:
# PlWepLockRand (pl_wep.cpp, the laser sight of every weapon held up) keeps the aim where the player left it instead
# of its random drift around it, and CameraScope::move (cam_extra.cpp, the scope of the rifles and the Mine Thrower;
# the binoculars have a camera of their own, CameraBinocular) adds no breathing sway to the view (its counters run on,
# so it goes on as the game when the switch goes off). Off: as the game.
--- a/src/game/pl_wep.cpp
